{{trans-mid}}
* Portuguese: {{t|pt|entronar}}, {{t|pt|entronizar}}
* Romanian: {{t+|ro|întrona}}, {{t+|ro|înscăuna}}
* Spanish: {{t+|es|entronizar}}
